column6:
@reboot (run once at startup), @hourly (0 * * * *), @daily (0 0 * * *), @weekly (0 0 * * 0), @monthly (0 0 1 * *), @yearly (0 0 1 1 *). These are shorthand aliases for common schedules and improve readability.

Remember: five fields: minute (0-59) hour (0-23) day-of-month (1-31) month (1-12) day-of-week (0-7). Mnemonic: 'Must Have Delicious Meals Daily.'

Example: 0 2 * * 1 = 'at 2:00 AM every Monday.' */15 * * * * = 'every 15 minutes.' 0 0 1 * * = 'midnight on the 1st of every month.'
